{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受条目明显更密，上下交替阅读也比Y左右分栏更费眼；重点高亮和按音乐时点出现能缓解，但不能完全消除这个负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X最突出的优势是把人物心理的矛盾讲得更具体：他既舍不得被当作自己人的亲近，又不愿回去承受曾经的委屈，这两股力量贯穿始终，最终自然走向带着想念继续生活。它对音乐变化的描述也明显更细，能让观众感受到情绪如何随着旋律、节奏、音型和力度逐步转变，而不只是看到笼统的悲伤、温暖或昂扬。Y的左右分栏更容易扫读，叙事也流畅，但部分音乐细节和人物心理之间的联系被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a9cbed3-366d-4d20-abb6-c8c962f9a7ed", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052810270796Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:29:32.354160+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5d48aa1b3337223709115502a50f42f8807c1693476b49f322abaae60f0d60b8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we